&lt;p&gt;From:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;writing code&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;orchestrating intelligence&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;❓ Real question:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Are we still “developers” in this model…&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;or are we becoming&lt;br&gt;
AI team managers?&lt;/p&gt;

