&lt;h2&gt;


  Closing Thoughts
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;PickUp started as an idea around interrupted work, but it grew into a broader tool for context continuity.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I wanted the experience to feel lightweight, human, and actually useful for real life, whether someone is returning to a study session, a side project, dinner prep, or unfinished planning.&lt;/p&gt;

